2.3.240 G2 360 98
2.4.240 E2 200 86
track c1
grid 1.1 e E4+G4+C5 .x.x.x.x|.x.x.x.X len=80
track c2
# the bubble: the organ on the e and the and of every beat, lower on the e
grid 1.1 s G3+C4+E4 .3x..3x..3x..3x.|.3x..3x..3x..3x. len=80
track c3
1.1.0  G3+C4+E4 1880 60
2.1.0  G3+C4+E4 1880 56
